description	"Luke Skywalker

The first of the new Jedi. A seasoned master with sharply honed skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- 42% less Red/8% more Blue damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Sense (3)

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (3)
- 90% slower skill cooldown"